es","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8280&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=445202&INSPECTION_NN=445202","fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":55,"title":"Physical facilities installed, maintained, and clean","repeat":false,"comment":"Mop basin was observed to be in need of resealing or re-caulking.  Areas subject to moisture must be non-absorbent and easily cleanable.  Ensure mop basin is re-caulked to prevent mold growth.\n\n6-101.11: (A) Materials indoor shall be SMOOTH, durable, and EASILY CLEANABLE. Areas subject to moisture must be Nonabsorbent.","citation":"","citation_text":""},{"item":55,"title":"Physical facilities installed, maintained, and clean","repeat":false,"comment":"Walk-in cooler containing milk cartons was observed to contain an accumulation of dust on the cooler fans and grates.  Ensure fans and grates are cleaned regularly to prevent contamination of food items in the walk-in cooler.\n\n6-501.12: (A) PHYSICAL FACILITIES shall be cleaned as often as necessary to keep them clean. (B) Except for cleaning that is necessary due to a spill or other accident, cleaning shall be done during periods when the least amount of FOOD is exposed such as after closing.","citation":"","citation_text":""}]},{"id":"430859","date":"2022-09-13","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8280&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=430859&INSPECTION_NN=430859","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"407790","date":"2022-01-27","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8280&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=407790&INSPECTION_NN=407790","fetched":true,"fi