STABLISHMENT=8280&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=354841&INSPECTION_NN=354841","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"344994","date":"2019-10-02","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":1,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8280&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=344994&INSPECTION_NN=344994","fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":22,"title":"Proper cold holding temperatures","repeat":false,"comment":"","citation":"3-501.16","citation_text":"3-501.16 (P) Shredded mozarrella and cheddar cheese inside a fridge in the serving area was probed at 55 degrees. Thermometers provided inside the fridge were reading close to 50 degrees on both sides. Exterior thermometer was reading at 41.5 degrees. Fridge contained shredded cheese, shredded lettuce, whole tomatoes, and condiments. These items were prepared for lunch service less than an hour prior, and are there only for convenience purposes during lunch service. PIC stated that this equipment has been known to go out of temp sometimes and this is not unusual. PIC removed the prepped items and transferred them to walk-in cooler. PIC also called service technician to service fridge. In the meantime, PIC ceased use of this equipment. Corrected on site."}]},{"id":"330671","date":"2019-05-06","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8280&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=330671&INSPECTION_NN=330671","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"323619","date":"2019-02-21","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":2,"repeat":0,"grp":2,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8280&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=323619&INSPECTION_NN=323619","fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":3,"title":"Management, food employee and conditional employee; knowledge, responsibilities and reporting","repeat":false,"comment":"No conditional employee form. Form given to supervisor at the end of inspection.","citation":"","citation_text":""},{"item":4,"title":"Proper use of restriction and exclusion","repeat":false,"comment":"No paperwork on restriction and exclusion. Form given to supervisor at end of inspection.","citation":"","citation_text":""},{"item":37,"title":"Food properly labeled; original container","repeat":false,"comment":"","citation":"3-602.11","citation_text":"3-602.11  (C) Prepackaged cookies are not properly labeled. Label with: 1) common name of food, 2) ingredients, 3) net quantities, 4) name and address of packager, 5) food allergens, 6) nutrition labeling, 7) salmonid fish additives used. Reference 3-602.11."},{"item":56,"title":"Adequate ventilation and lighting; designated areas used","repeat":false,"comment":"6-501.110  (C) Employees were found not using the designated dressing rooms / changing areas or designated employees lockers when changing clothes or storing personal articles. Dressing rooms and lockers or other suitable facilities shall be used if employees regularly change clothes or store personal articles in the establishment while working. Reference 6-501.110.","citation":"6-501.14","citation_text":"6-501.14  (C) [Intake air / Exhaust air ducts (vents)] in the grill area were found with accumulation of dust on them. Intake and exhaust air ducts shall be cleaned and filters changed so they are not a source of contamination by dust, dirt, and other materials."}]},{"id":"273635","date":"2018-04-26","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=8280&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=273635&INSPECTION_NN=273635","